- **Morrison – Sooner 138 kV, 07-23 → 09-17** — your sheet records this for `lnosage_og-webbtap4` as "5/7–6/30". It is back and extended through 09-17, covering bid_dt.
- **Canadian River 345/138 XFMR → 08-14** — matches `lnmdwst-frnkln1`'s contingency (`okgewfec:cdrlncanadn1noble4wal`).
- **MPS-Missouri cluster** around `lnmaurerlk-carroltn` (KCPL nodes): Warrensburg East 161/69 XFMR + Warrensburg East–Warrensburg Plant 69 kV (→08-05 19:00), Cole Camp–Sedalia Plant (→08-12), 13 & 40–Warrensburg Plant (→10-30), Sedalia 161/69 XFMR (→12-31).
